  "question": {
    "text": "Velocity of a particle moving in a straight line varies with its displacement as <math> <mrow> <mtext>v</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>4</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mtext>s</mtext> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>m/s</mtext> </mrow> </math>. Displacement of particle at time t = 0 is s = 0. Find displacement of particle at time t = 2 s."
  },
